# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (the Fargate robot image), which does
# `COPY . /ros2_ws/src` and then `colcon build`. Keep this tight for three
# reasons: the COPY layer sits ABOVE the ~600MB pip layer, so anything that
# leaks in busts the cache on every unrelated edit; colcon chokes on duplicate
# package.xml names (cdk.out stages whole copies of this repo); and secrets in
# the context get baked into a published ECR layer.
#
# NOTE: Go2AgentCoreStack stages the repo root as a CDK asset, so CDK reads this
# file too — `voice_agent/` must stay in the context for its `COPY voice_agent/`.

.git
.github

# Virtualenvs. The glob matters: plain `.venv` does NOT match `.venv-voice`.
.venv*

# colcon's own output, plus the vendored copy of the workspace.
ros2_ws
build
install
log

# CDK: node_modules (217MB) and cdk.out (627MB, holding staged copies of this
# repo whose duplicate package.xml files confuse colcon). Editing any stack or
# running `cdk deploy` on an unrelated stack would otherwise force a rebuild.
deployment

# Gitignored SLAM artifacts (89MB), regenerated by mapping.launch.py and never
# read by the image — nav2 gets its map from a path inside the container.
maps

# Operator tooling and docs: not imported by any ROS package.
scripts
docker/logs
DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md
AWS_DEPLOYMENT.md
README.md

# Secrets. Both are gitignored but were landing in an ECR image layer via
# `COPY .`; the ECS task gets its credentials from the task role instead.
docker/.env
docker/go2_accessKeys.csv

# Large binaries and editor/OS cruft.
*.ply
*.png
*.drawio
*.drawio.bkp
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.claude
.vscode
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
